==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|fro}} {{term|reprochier|lang=fro}} (Modern {{term|reprocher|lang=fr}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/rɪˈpɹəʊtʃ/}}, {{SAMPA|/rI"pr@UtS/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/rɪˈpɹoʊtʃ/}}
* {{audio|en-us-reproach.ogg|Audio (US)}}
